     "I&#39;ve been trying to stay out of commenting on things I don&#39;t\r<br>understand well.  I don&#39;t understand the MATLAB notation well\r<br>enough to understand if you coded it correctly in Stan.  But it\r<br>looks like you may have missed an exp(), which would make adding\r<br>the machine precision meaningless (and just pull the parameter\r<br>away from being a simplex).\r<br>\r<br>The best thing to do is run tests to make sure you&#39;re getting\r<br>what you think you&#39;re getting.  Then fit with simulated data to\r<br>make sure the model&#39;s right.\r<br>\r<br>- Bob\r<br>"
